[{"client_msg_id":"5d611a97-ebe6-49c2-bf6d-5a1f342a86df","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"\u0026gt; ゆくゆくは「この問題は DP を使えば解ける」ってのを判断できるようにならないといけない\nDPはほんとによく出るので基本疑うぐらいがちょうどよい\nむしろそういう見た目をしていないのに 2分探索とかだと爆発する","ts":"1633942499.045000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"khI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"101e0b23-d0ae-44a9-ab59-267471bca8e3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"にしてもプログラミング言語ってガンガンバージョン上がるから、こういうジャッジサービスは大変よね。ころころ変えちゃうと過去の評価との差が出ちゃうし。かといってずっと古いバージョンだと参加しづらくなる","ts":"1633880383.042500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lY5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0598daa-2aa8-41de-a3cd-2cc29263ec90","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あとこの DP のやつは DP で解ける前提だからいきなりそれで考えられるけど、ゆくゆくは「この問題は DP を使えば解ける」ってのを判断できるようにならないといけないわけよな。めちゃくちゃ先のステップだと思うけど","ts":"1633880302.041500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8YfwM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03796b11-e19c-4667-8301-966fe323d4aa","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vim scriptでも最初何がどこにあるのか、何ができるのかさっぱりだったのでそれと同じことだと思いたい \u0026gt; パターン","ts":"1633880223.040400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"njmCO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04a4b8f6-e1c4-4c9a-98cf-967edadcacc9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"完全に勘違いしていた、あぶない","ts":"1633880188.039400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ujZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c188a0c-4937-478d-9e94-e9c0318461ae","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ですです。アレ","ts":"1633880131.038700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jxz4U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"359fd2c9-7b39-44cd-8d01-8694c1dabe97","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"以前thincaさんのブログで見たあの方法と同じか","ts":"1633880118.038500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iRJ+8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3e367a9-81ce-4dc2-8176-48d8017c40c2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あー、完全理解","ts":"1633880102.038000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2y6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef5c0c78-5f4f-478e-b0b3-745b512ecc1a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"yukicoder での Vim script は Vim がバッチモードで立ち上がってコードは Vim script として解釈される(`-S`) ので、`:print` コマンドを実行してやればバッファの 1 行目の内容が出力されます。つまり `p` で終わり","ts":"1633880051.037200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"saTca"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffb24801-1da3-4e5a-a9d9-d138170f5b15","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"で、この問題は条件がごちゃごちゃ入ってくるけど入力をそのまま出力すれば正解になる","ts":"1633879994.036200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JBH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5485ff17-9cff-4afb-8cbe-80c1669879e1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ダミーでもない","ts":"1633879959.035300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"05Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3276ced9-e041-484f-8e6e-517f21b1cd28","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あー、pはダミーかw","ts":"1633879948.035000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7N9xW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54adef17-8a90-472f-9cf5-f53338ce53e5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いや、初期バッファに標準入力が入ってきます","ts":"1633879935.034600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fMqd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ed6fdba-512e-4ac0-801f-6631bd8552e8","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"レジスタに入力入ってるのかなるほど","ts":"1633879906.033900","tea